# Phase 8b-3 review M2: panel fades during fast wheel spins over split
# screens (main menu, Settings, Date & Time). The arrival fade's first
# frame stays paced (hl_k -1, "started, no frame yet") and is never lost:
# every row that rests gets its panel, a row passed in a spin gets none,
# and no fade frame is pushed out of the 30 fps turn of a list glide.
# Count per run: "panel arrive" and "update anim:xfade" lines in sim.log.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p8b-fastspin.script

wait 4000            # boot to the main menu
wheel +3 40          # fast to Settings
wheel -3 40
wheel +3 40
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1500
wheel +16 40         # fast spin to Reset Settings (row 17)
wait 900
shot settings_spin   # Reset Settings' tile, not a stale row's
wheel -16 40         # fast back to About
wait 900
shot settings_back   # the capacity panel
wheel +12 40         # Date & Time
wait 900
shot date_time       # the calendar page
key SELECT
wait 1500
wheel +4 40          # Date & Time's own list, fast
wait 900
shot dt_list
wheel -4 40
wait 900
shot dt_list_back
quit
